{
  "platform": "qoder",
  "version": "cn",
  "name": "Qoder 国内版 · 每日 100 Credits",
  "contract_version": "2026-11-18.real-6",
  "status": "active",
  "template": false,
  "note": "真实接口，来源于 L0NE-6/Qoder-Daily 与 88lin/workbuddy-auto-signin 的 Qoder 部分。两步骤：先 GET campaigns，筛选 actionType=CLAIM_BENEFIT 且 benefit.kind=CREDITS 的每日活动，捕获 campaignId，再 POST claim。需 Cosy 设备风控头（Cosy-MachineId/Token/Code/Type），可通过 QODER_EXTRA_HEADERS 注入 JSON。活动资格：自 2026-11-19 10:00 起每日 100 通用 Credits 仅面向 Pro 试用期及 Lite/Pro/Pro+/Ultra 个人付费订阅用户，免费体验版不再开放领取；资格不符时 campaigns 无 CLAIM_BENEFIT 属平台规则，非契约漂移。",
  "upstream_references": [
    "L0NE-6/Qoder-Daily",
    "88lin/workbuddy-auto-signin"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "timeout": 25,
    "headers": {
      "Accept": "application/json",
      "User-Agent": "Qoder/claim",
      "Cosy-ClientType": "10",
      "Cosy-Version": "${cred.client_version}",
      "Cosy-MachineOS": "${cred.machine_os}",
      "Cosy-MachineId": "${cred.machine_id}",
      "Cosy-MachineHostname": "${cred.machine_hostname}",
      "Cosy-MachineToken": "${cred.machine_token}",
      "Cosy-MachineCode": "${cred.machine_code}",
      "Cosy-MachineType": "${cred.machine_type}"
    }
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "header": "Authorization",
    "prefix": "Bearer ",
    "headers": {
      "Authorization": "Bearer ${token}"
    }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "campaigns",
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://openapi.qoder.com.cn/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns",
      "headers": {},
      "capture": [
        {
          "name": "campaign_id",
          "path": "$.campaigns",
          "select": {
            "actionType": "CLAIM_BENEFIT",
            "benefit.kind": "CREDITS",
            "benefit.amount": 100,
            "claimStatus": "CLAIMABLE"
          },
          "field": "$.campaignId",
          "simulate": "sim-daily-100"
        }
      ],
      "expected_shape": {
        "type": "object",
        "required_paths": [],
        "field_types": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "checkin",
      "method": "POST",
      "url": "https://openapi.qoder.com.cn/sash/api/v1/me/campaigns/${var.campaign_id}/claim",
      "headers": {},
      "when": {
        "var.campaign_id": {
          "exists": true,
          "truthy": true
        }
      },
      "expected_shape": {
        "type": "object",
        "required_paths": [],
        "field_types": {}
      }
    }
  ],
  "response": {
    "json_paths": {
      "success": [
        "$.status",
        "$.data.status"
      ],
      "already": [
        "$.status"
      ],
      "failed": [
        "$.failureCode",
        "$.code"
      ],
      "credits": [
        "$.benefit.amount",
        "$.data.benefit.amount"
      ],
      "message": [
        "$.message",
        "$.msg",
        "$.failureCode"
      ]
    },
    "values": {
      "success": [
        "CLAIMED",
        "GRANTED",
        "SUCCESS"
      ],
      "already": [
        "BLOCKED",
        "ALREADY_CLAIMED",
        "CLAIMED"
      ],
      "failed": [
        "SAME_PERSON_ALREADY_CLAIMED",
        "INTERNAL_ERROR",
        401,
        403,
        409
      ]
    },
    "expected_shape": {
      "type": "object",
      "required_paths": [],
      "field_types": {}
    },
    "verdicts": [
      {
        "status": "failed",
        "fatal": true,
        "steps": [
          "campaigns"
        ],
        "message": "Qoder 凭据已失效（查询活动时鉴权被拒），请重新登录客户端或重新生成凭据",
        "match": {
          "$.code": {
            "in": [
              "TOKEN_EXPIRE",
              "TOKEN_INVALID",
              "UNAUTHORIZED",
              "INVALID_TOKEN",
              "FORBIDDEN"
            ]
          }
        },
        "auth": true
      },
      {
        "status": "failed",
        "fatal": true,
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "Qoder 凭据已失效（领取积分时鉴权被拒），请重新登录客户端或重新生成凭据",
        "match": {
          "$.code": {
            "in": [
              "TOKEN_EXPIRE",
              "TOKEN_INVALID",
              "UNAUTHORIZED",
              "INVALID_TOKEN",
              "FORBIDDEN"
            ]
          }
        },
        "auth": true
      },
      {
        "status": "skipped",
        "steps": [
          "campaigns"
        ],
        "message": "当前无可领取的每日 Credits 活动（未开窗或今日已领完）",
        "match": {
          "var.campaign_id": {
            "exists": false
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "already",
        "steps": [
          "campaigns"
        ],
        "message": "活动已领取（claimStatus=CLAIMED）",
        "match": {
          "$.status": {
            "equals": [
              "CLAIMED"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "already",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "同一设备身份下今日已领取（BLOCKED）",
        "match": {
          "$.status": {
            "equals": [
              "BLOCKED"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "already",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "活动已领取（重复领取）",
        "match": {
          "$.failureCode": {
            "equals": [
              "SAME_PERSON_ALREADY_CLAIMED"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "failed",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "领取失败（上游错误）",
        "match": {
          "$.failureCode": {
            "equals": [
              "INTERNAL_ERROR"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "status": "success",
        "steps": [
          "checkin"
        ],
        "message": "Qoder Credits 领取成功",
        "credits_path": "$.benefit.amount",
        "match": {
          "$.status": {
            "equals": [
              "CLAIMED",
              "GRANTED",
              "SUCCESS"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "change_signals": [
    "活动列表被设备风控降级：缺 Cosy-MachineToken/Code/Type 时只返回订阅推广，每日 CLAIM_BENEFIT 活动不会出现在 campaigns 里（看起来像没有活动）",
    "鉴权失效（HTTP 401 / code=TOKEN_EXPIRE）必须先于「无可领活动」判定，否则会被当成正常跳过",
    "claim 响应为扁平结构：benefit.amount 在顶层（不在 data 下）",
    "缺少 Cosy-ClientType: 10 时服务端返回空 campaigns（不是没有活动）",
    "活动窗口（北京时间 10:00）变化",
    "campaigns 返回结构 $.campaigns[] 字段名变化",
    "筛选条件 actionType / benefit.kind / claimStatus 变化",
    "Cosy 设备风控头缺失导致 403",
    "出现新的 BLOCKED 失败码"
  ]
}
